translate italian adrians3_7a676a00:

    # gg "I play a lot of games. Probably too much really."
    gg "Gioco un sacco ai videogiochi. Probabilmente anche troppo, in realtà."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianConversations/adrians3.rpy:42
translate italian adrians3_6107ca45:

    # gg "My dad was always on my back for playing video games too much and not really accomplishing anything."
    gg "Anche mio padre mi stava sempre addosso perché giocavo troppo ai videogiochi e non combinavo nulla di concreto."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianConversations/adrians3.rpy:43
translate italian adrians3_e3a5af82:

    # gg "So while I love playing games, there's always this nagging guilt in the back of my head when I do."
    gg "Quindi, anche se adoro giocare, c’è sempre questo fastidioso senso di colpa in fondo alla mia mente quando lo faccio."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianConversations/adrians3.rpy:44
translate italian adrians3_324d4d69:

    # gg "Like I'm doing something wrong."
    gg "Come se stessi facendo qualcosa di sbagliato."

# game/Scenes/Adrian/AdrianConversations/adrians3.rpy:45
translate italian adrians3_e090187a:

    # pc "Sorry. That sucks."
